### def rewind -> nil

列挙状態を巻き戻します。

```ruby title="例"
require 'prime'
generator = Prime::EratosthenesGenerator.new
p generator.next # => 2
p generator.next # => 3
p generator.next # => 5

generator.rewind

p generator.next # => 2
```

